## Notes: Records boss kills and what their corpses, chests and group loot rolls drop, for wowamobi.com. Passive only: never loots, rolls or clicks for you, and stores no player names. /amobiloot
## Notes-zhTW: 記下首領擊殺和屍體、寶箱、隊伍擲骰的掉落，給阿莫比網站（wowamobi.com）算掉落率。只被動記錄：不會替你撿東西、擲骰或點任何東西，也不存玩家的名字。/amobiloot 看記了多少
